///               ->  Bitmap Index Scan on idx_users_age
///                     Index Cond: (age >= 0)
/// 
/// === direct_and_nested_mixed (variant 1) ===
/// Limit
///   ->  Sort
///         Sort Key: id
///         ->  Index Scan using idx_users_age_updated_at on users
///               Index Cond: ((age >= 0) AND (age <= 0))
///               Filter: ((name)::text ~~ 'dummy'::text)
